abstract: >-
  UTIOM is a threat-informed Security Operations operating framework that connects leadership
  and governance, business consequence, threat understanding, telemetry and detection engineering,
  operational response, validation, evidence and continuous improvement into one coherent system.
  Version 1.4 adds a system-integrity assessment view while preserving the canonical three pillars,
  seven lifecycle phases and three cross-cutting enablers.
